<p>Hey! Sorry, not a greenlighter.</p>
<p>I actually quite like this idea. It's simple and to the point, and provides a nice little story about good food. However, the anomaly itself feels a little too tame- why would the Foundation need to contain a pizza place that just sells good pizza? It doesn't quite seem like the Foundation would be concerned with this place in the slightest, other than potentially recording its existence and nothing more. I recommend that you include some sort of stakes to this SCP; the Foundation needs a good reason to want to interview this guy about his pizza.</p>
<p>That all being said, I think that this article could be enjoyable as it is. I don't really have much else to say here&#8230; sorry that I had so little for you! Good luck developing your idea!</p>

